WEBVTT

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.172
Women are not making it
to the top of any profession

00:00:33.196 --> 00:00:34.568
anywhere in the world.

00:00:35.094 --> 00:00:37.527
The numbers tell the story quite clearly.

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:40.589
190 heads of state --
nine are women.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.466
Of all the people
in parliament in the world,

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.339
13 percent are women.

00:00:45.798 --> 00:00:48.642
In the corporate sector, women at the top,

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:50.976
C-level jobs, board seats --

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.741
tops out at 15, 16 percent.

00:00:53.765 --> 00:00:56.717
The numbers have not moved since 2002

00:00:56.741 --> 00:00:58.690
and are going in the wrong direction.

00:00:59.212 --> 00:01:01.344
And even in the non-profit world,